# Claude Code session state, none of it project content:
#   worktrees/ holds live `git worktree` checkouts of this same repo — committing one nests a
#   working tree inside the branch it was cut from. Anything shared (a project settings.json,
#   CLAUDE.md) is deliberately NOT ignored here.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/RESUME.md
